  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Tarawa Renewable Energy Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The South Tarawa Renewable Energy Project (STREP or the Project) will support upscaling of solar power generation in Kiribati. The Project will reduce dependence on fossil fuel imports by increasing the renewable energy (RE) percentage of electricity generation. STREP has three outputs: (1) Solar photovoltaic and battery storage system installed; (2) enabling framework for renewable energy adopted; and, (3) institutional capacity in renewable energy project development, management and supervision enhanced</narrative>
  </description>
